  "description": "The perfect combination of sporty flat-bar handling and fitness riding fun, with a helping hand on tap whenever you need it. Equipped with guards, lights, stand and rack for total urban prowess.\n\nA consummate urban professional, the eSPEEDER 400 EQ pairs a sporty feeling and sleek flat-barred frame with the almost invisible assistance of a hub drive motor to deliver the ultimate do-anything fitness machine. The low-drag motor design means it's easy to pedal over the assistance limit, while the 250 Wh internal battery will help support you on hills, even if you've loaded up the standard-fit rack. Lights, mudguards and kickstand help keep you and the bike safe, while powerful Shimano hydraulic disc brakes, smooth shifting drivetrain offer benchmark control.\n\nOur normal SPEEDER is all about urban and fitness efficiency that combines fast-rolling tyres with a straight handlebar set-up and powerful disc brakes. Our eSPEEDER follows in exactly those footsteps only with the addition of a the latest MAHLE ebikemotion X30 rear hub motor and internal 250 Wh battery for that extra bit of climbing or 'catch up' speed when the legs get a bit tired. You can even use an externally mounted 208 Wh MAHLE Range Extender to boost range. The stylish appearance combined with the more upright riding position and fast-rolling 700c wheels makes the SPEEDER the perfect urban and commuting bike for everybody looking for a sporty assisted city bike. The eSPEEDER 200 SE features the X35+ drive unit.",
